# Visual style（模板）

Quiet product UI — not a purple SaaS dashboard, not cream-serif editorial by default.

## Brand surfaces

Splash / onboarding / marketing: one hero brand name, one short supporting line, one dominant visual. No stats chips or overlay badges in the first viewport.

## Layout

「占满」= fill the **content column**, not the physical screen.

- Keep consistent left/right page insets with body text
- Images/cards align with text on both edges
- Page gutters stay; no accidental edge-to-edge bleed unless intentional

## Reading vs brand

Long-form reading stays paper-white for legibility unless the product explicitly chooses dark reading.

## Cards

Cards are for interaction or content units; avoid card-for-everything. Prefer one job per section.
